Prefix: : <https://finsight-tech.com/ontology/examples/economic-mechanisms/bond#>

Ontology: <https://finsight-tech.com/ontology/examples/economic-mechanisms/fixed-rate-bond>


# ************************************************************************
# Fixed-Rate Bond - Economic Structure
# ************************************************************************
#
# Models a fixed-rate bond through principal, interest and maturity terms.
# The example shows that the product class alone does not carry all of the
# economic meaning of the bond.
#


Class: Bond


### Economic terms

Class: PrincipalTerms

Class: InterestTerms

Class: FixedRateInterestTerms
    SubClassOf: InterestTerms

Class: MaturityTerms

Class: Rate

Class: FixedRate
    SubClassOf: Rate

Class: CalculationBasis

Class: PaymentSchedule


### Product-to-terms relationships

ObjectProperty: hasPrincipalTerms
    Domain: Bond
    Range: PrincipalTerms

ObjectProperty: hasInterestTerms
    Domain: Bond
    Range: InterestTerms

ObjectProperty: hasMaturityTerms
    Domain: Bond
    Range: MaturityTerms


### Interest-term relationships

ObjectProperty: hasRate
    Domain: InterestTerms
    Range: Rate

ObjectProperty: usesCalculationBasis
    Domain: InterestTerms
    Range: CalculationBasis

ObjectProperty: hasPaymentSchedule
    Domain: InterestTerms
    Range: PaymentSchedule


### Product type described through its economic structure

Class: FixedRateBond
    EquivalentTo:
        Bond and hasInterestTerms some FixedRateInterestTerms

Class: FixedRateInterestTerms
    SubClassOf:
        hasRate some FixedRate,
        usesCalculationBasis some CalculationBasis,
        hasPaymentSchedule some PaymentSchedule
